{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_04_beg","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_04","title":"復仇之魂","storyCode":"TW-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0e3667c28e31b318765247b23c4d3156f7871560077386052270fef5c089f152","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 4上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼會......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這真是......慘不忍睹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火災，現場已經處理過了，時間也過了很久。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，羅德島的物資箱，編號，日期，一應俱全......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的灰塵很規則，曾經有個某個方形的物體放在箱子上吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許是安托的工作牌，她不喜歡掛在身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"卡達幹員，斷崖幹員，現在情況有變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這我也明白的啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"既然灰喉姐和艾爾斯把我從山上救下來了，我一定會好好幫忙的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"不要叫我艾爾斯......唉，萊恩哈特到底和你們說了些什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"天災造成的後果很嚴重，沃倫姆德現在不會好過，那裡的天災信使在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是萊恩哈特或者地靈小姐在的話，至少情況不會這麼糟糕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"假設是無意義的......我們應該做好最壞的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"駐紮在城鎮外，你們倆會有困難嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......我畢竟是天災信使的專職護衛，而這一位幹員是為了拍攝影片素材深入冬靈山脈然後迅速遇難的“天才兒童”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡達","speakerId":"char_328_cammou","isRemote":false,"text":"都這個時候了你也要損我的嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斷崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"只是開開玩笑，不然......灰喉不會希望我們現在就衝進鎮上砸開議事廳的大門，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，忍耐一下，我去確認一下安托的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"去去就回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......饑荒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"饑荒。饑荒會毀了所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想問什麼，沃倫姆德這樣規模的城鎮，當然有自給自足的能力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是大裂谷出現的那天，沒有那麼多源石從地下刺穿構造區，割裂地塊，炸毀農田和供給設施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，沒有在商業區和城鎮中心發生爆炸，已經是萬幸了，但即使如此我們依舊損失慘重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"季節也很糟糕，已經入秋，我們的航線正在向冬靈山脈進發，今年的冬天會來得很早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有把這一事實告訴所有人，是不希望引發不必要的恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我們被不知情的自己人捅了刀子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"那些叛徒......怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜帶著年輕人去排查了，如果沒有人帶路，沒人能夠碰到動力爐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"各個街道應該有自己的備用拖拉設備，情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣行進速度太慢了，頂多只有其他城鎮的八分之一，我們無法在冬天之前離開山脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"糧倉不能出任何問題，加派人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"人手......哪怕是老人和孩子，只要還願意拿起武器的，都已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"對糧倉出手，等同於殺死沃倫姆德所有的人！他們，他們再怎麼也不至於......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"別把他們想得太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"十二音街道，也就是隔離區，之所以那麼蕭條，也是因為......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我說，單純是因為感染者的人數問題導致配給縮水，你們信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你們信不信根本不重要，他們信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要拆掉倉庫的門，仔細檢查每一顆穀穗，才會相信我們說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，難道我們就要讓他們拆嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的只是檢查檢查，我倒也樂意開誠佈公，但不是每個人都打算看看就算了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"即使官方沒有公告，聰明人也能從路線和時令推算出沃倫姆德將在冬天遭遇的大饑荒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們煽動，他們掠奪，今天的所作所為，只是為了部分人自己活下去，而讓另一部分人餓死，說白了，就是在找藉口搶劫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島是感染者問題對策專家，我當然信，安托醫生的專業和你們的戰鬥足以說明一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——這片大地上的難題，就只有礦石病而已嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......即使在這個場合，我也必須為安托發問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一場謀殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"——無關人士都出去！長官和羅德島的二位有要事想談！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，交給你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來，這不是個可以放在檯面上進行的話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"哪種有關謀殺的話題可以放在檯面上進行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的隱瞞會招致惡果——不那麼正式的用詞，我現在就看你們很不爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島幹員安托在沃倫姆德捲入一起謀殺事件殉職，我需要得到一個答覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有，根據那位清醒過來的感染者居民的證詞，他們也在尋找“兇手”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"也許兇手就在他們之中，常見的挑撥伎倆，賊喊捉賊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但在我們討論兇手之前，我想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——打住，你沒必要說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是我也有良心不安的時候，如果你提出請求，會讓我感覺很難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但沃倫姆德還要靠羅德島解圍，事到如今，已經沒有難為你們的必要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"如此草率的處理我感到很抱歉，但他們大都是感染者，只有擺放在這樣的地下才能讓其他人安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......很冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"無論何時何地，我都會確保這些製冷裝置的運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"很精緻的法術，不虧是萊塔尼亞的士官長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......受害者，八名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德的四位居民，安托醫生，還有三個來自外界的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞弗林長官的兒子......托爾瓦爾德先生也在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔佳娜把這件事也告訴你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我的失職......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"安托......你在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你可真難找啊......蠢貓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......她是怎麼辨認出......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（塞弗林長官......我們，讓她們獨處一會吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":".......好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......她的強勢時常讓我忘記，她也只是個努力前進的小女孩，和塔佳娜差不多的年紀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜姐姐......她在強撐著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！您不該再抽煙了！我說過的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"吸煙會讓您的支氣管疾病更加——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您難道——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想到了。小狐狸，你比我想的還要敏銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在，先幫我保密吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐......好受點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"以你的年紀來說，很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道現在我眼睛腫了，你是在諷刺我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"痛失好友還能保持這樣的冷靜，我沒有什麼可嘲笑你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......事情還沒完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，事情還沒完。現在，希望我們是一條戰線了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"城防法術發生裝置L-44“留聲機”的自律施術單元，簡單來說，這就是兇器了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"這種程度的破壞力在民間當然是非法的，但反過來說，只要是受過高等教育的萊塔尼亞人，就有辦法驅動這枚核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"超載，升溫，爆炎，畢竟是城防設備的一部分，源石技藝工程很複雜，不是誰都能用得來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......就是這個東西，就是有人用這個東西，把安托給......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們要找出兇手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後......我要他付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......真意外，原來不安和悲傷過去了之後，你選擇的是復仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐......我們不應該......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道，作為羅德島的幹員，凱爾希醫生的學徒，我應該比誰都清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但唯獨那個人——那個人必須接受審判！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"安托做了什麼？她在幫助感染者，她在幫助他們！安托為什麼要遭受這一切！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"至少——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"至少......至少我想問問他......為什麼要這麼做......憑什麼這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林長官，鈴蘭小姐，亞葉小——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......亞葉小姐已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"她們已經見過面了......你的樣子很慌張，又出什麼岔子了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。在搜查的過程中，感染者又和普通人發生了衝突......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"又一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次......代表們出面都安撫不了大家的情緒，他們嚷嚷著要和那些武裝感染者宣戰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"城鎮的移動手段被大幅度控制，這意味著什麼很多人都明白......他們忍無可忍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"但是、但是我們有新的發現......串通感染者的居民裡有很多人並不是感染者，他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已經猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"冬靈人，該死的部族，他們又來糾纏沃倫姆德了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["斷崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_328_cammou","aliases":["卡達"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
